Package: byteguru-apps-daemon
Source: byteguru
Version: 1.0.0-1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: ByteguruOS Team <devel@byteguru.example>
Installed-Size: 47
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11)
Recommends: flatpak, byteguru-wincompat
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: ByteguruOS session daemon with a unified application model
 Presents Flatpak apps, .desktop entries and WCV manifests as one list and
 returns an executable launch plan, including coverage level and sandbox
 warnings. WinCompat is an optional dependency: with it removed the system
 loses the ability to run Windows applications and stays a complete desktop.
